stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Snapshot: trigger (watcher / timer / CLI / attach)
    Snapshot --> Compare: for each shared profile<br/>L = hash(normalized local)<br/>R = hash(shared)<br/>B = last-synced hash (this host)
    Compare --> InSync: L == R
    Compare --> Behind: L == B, R != B
    Compare --> Ahead: L != B, R == B
    Compare --> FirstRun: no B, L != R
    Compare --> Diverged: L != B, R != B, L != R
    FirstRun --> Ahead: shared copy empty
    FirstRun --> Diverged: shared copy exists
    Behind --> Pull: quit app, back up local,<br/>swap, relaunch
    Ahead --> Push: write temp, verify hash,<br/>atomic rename, current.json last
    Pull --> Verify: re-hash local == R?
    Push --> Verify: re-read shared == L?
    Verify --> InSync: ok, B := hash
    Verify --> Failed: mismatch
    Failed --> Notify: restore pre-swap backup
    Diverged --> Notify: keep both snapshots,<br/>touch nothing
    InSync --> [*]
    Notify --> [*]: waits for schrodeck resolve
